[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746158255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120412#issuecomment-4746158255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120412","id":4746158255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGuSgrw","user":{"login":"tarnishedmoth","id":87274781,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Mjc0Nzgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87274781?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth","html_url":"https://github.com/tarnishedmoth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tarnishedmoth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T21:10:00Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T21:13:45Z","body":"Adding a link to this comment which actually mentions part of the cause, which is meshes with low poly counts have more inaccurate shadows.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219#pullrequestreview-2983649861\n\nExample:\nBox meshes with no subdivision\n\n<img width=\"1638\" height=\"1202\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa81d7cf-4cb2-497c-9729-e84f412b029e\" />\n\nBox meshes with 3 subdivisions on the long axes.\n\n<img width=\"1796\" height=\"1218\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb74b4c5-636e-4009-9e39-e4166795c69e\" />\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746158255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746265826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120412#issuecomment-4746265826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120412","id":4746265826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGuZE4g","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T21:26:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T21:26:58Z","body":"Duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119183\n\nYou need to subdivide those boxes a bit more","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746265826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4746275241","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120412#issuecomment-4746275241","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120412","id":4746275241,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGuZpqQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-18T21:28:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T21:29:49Z","body":"To clarify, how many subdivisions you need to use depends on the size of the BoxMesh and the area covered by the AreaLight3D. Small boxes only need 1 subdivision while a huge box might need 10 or more. The distortion is applied on a per-vertex basis, which is why it becomes more accurate at higher subdivision counts.\n\nSee the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/3d/lights_and_shadows.html#area-light\n) for details.\n\nTo get accurate shadows from area lights without needing to subdivide some meshes or bake lightmaps (with the light in Static bake mode), we'd need raytraced shadows which are more precise, but also much more demanding.","author_associat